FormatLegacy {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Lang/LangFormat.cpp
    src   "'{0}' has 1.x declarations, and what the printer writes for those is 2.0 text; rewriting 1.x as 2.0 is 'dsc migrate', so 'fmt' leaves the file as it is."
    text  "'{0}' 里有 1.x 声明，而打印器为这些声明写出的是 2.0 文本；把 1.x 改写成 2.0 是 'dsc migrate' 的事，所以 'fmt' 保持该文件原样。"
    state machine
}

FormatPreprocessor {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Lang/LangFormat.cpp
    src   "'{0}' uses the preprocessor outside a custom body; 'fmt' reads the file as it is on disk and would have to drop one side of every '#if', so it leaves the file as it is."
    text  "'{0}' 在 custom 函数体之外使用了预处理器；'fmt' 按磁盘上的原样读取文件，那样就得丢掉每个 '#if' 的一侧，所以它保持该文件原样。"
    state machine
}
